{"schema":1,"kind":"decision","id":"01KXS0GFZ77VQ17HXME21391S1","title":"Publish Authority genesis without exposing partial state","decision":"Initialize and sync genesis at a deterministic private sibling path, durably stage its exact checkpoint, publish it with a same-directory no-clobber hard link, sync the directory, remove the preparation link, sync again, then reopen and promote.","alternatives":[{"option":"Initialize the final database pathname in place","why_rejected":"a crash can strand an empty or partially initialized final file that neither bootstrap nor open can safely recover"},{"option":"Rename the prepared database over the final path","why_rejected":"ordinary rename can replace an attacker- or operator-created target instead of preserving bootstrap exclusivity"},{"option":"Treat empty retention plus any initialized final database as recoverable","why_rejected":"loss of retention could then re-anchor an old signed genesis and hide rollback"}],"scope":["crates/gommage-core/src/authority/{recovery.rs,storage.rs,schema.rs}"],"commits":["e58dccf2f046b0fba171d8423141568bf865cc35"],"author":"codex","confidence":"medium","tags":[],"ts":1784324571111}
